\[d(n) = f(n)(n) + 1 \quad \text{for all } n \in \mathbb{N}\] This $d$ is simultaneously:

\begin{itemize}
 \item \textbf{Outside} the image of $f$ (for all $n$, $d \neq f(n)$ by construction ---
